TDQEV-oKMfKi3AA","date":"2019-07-21T23:45:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8916358947753906,"text_excerpt":"Delicious food. Never disappointed! I always get the boneless chicken with white meat. Both the egg drop soup and hot and sour soup are great. The look of the restaurant hasn't changed in years, but the food makes up for it. Highly recommend for Chinese food in the Jefferson area. Large portions."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
